== diags.diag/unless-parenthesized
BYN1022 4:5 `unless` with `&&`/`||` reads as a double negative
  label a compound condition
  help use `if` with the negated condition
  fix 4:5-4:22 if !(a && a)
BYN1007 7:5 `unless` with a negated condition is a double negative
  label `unless` already negates
  help use `if` with the condition as written
  fix 7:5-7:18 if a
BYN1007 10:12 `unless` with a negated condition is a double negative
  label `unless` already negates
  help use `if` with the condition as written
  fix 10:12-10:23 if a
BYN1022 11:12 `unless` with `&&`/`||` reads as a double negative
  label a compound condition
  help use `if` with the negated condition
  fix 11:12-11:29 if !(a || a)
BYN1023 12:12 `unless x is null` is not allowed; write `if x is not null`
  label a negated null test
  help use `if` with `is not null`
  fix 12:12-12:30 if p is not null
